  m_Name: Forest_Cabin_1
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Game.Collectable.CollectableItem
  id: Forest_Cabin_1
  headerName: "House Notes \u2014 1"
  content: "\tThe radio reported that sections of the earth's crust are separating
    and rising \u2014 great slabs of ground lifting into the sky. Some continents
    remain joined; others have already broken apart. What floats will eventually
    fall and be destroyed.\n\r\n\tThey say there are evacuation centers being built
    on high ground. A lighthouse to mark them. I have to go. I have to go now."
  type: 0
